## 📊 **13. MAINTENANCE SUCCESS METRICS**

### **Operational Metrics**
1. **System Reliability**
   - **Uptime**: > 99.9% system availability
   - **MTTR**: < 1 hour mean time to repair
   - **MTBF**: > 720 hours mean time between failures
   - **Error Rate**: < 0.1% error rate

2. **Maintenance Efficiency**
   - **Update Success Rate**: > 95% successful updates
   - **Maintenance Cost**: < 20% of total system cost
   - **Automation Rate**: > 80% automated maintenance
   - **Team Productivity**: > 90% task completion rate

### **Quality Metrics**
1. **Code Quality**
   - **Code Coverage**: > 80% test coverage
   - **Technical Debt**: < 10% debt ratio
   - **Code Duplication**: < 5% duplicate code
   - **Security Score**: > 90% security score

2. **Documentation Quality**
   - **Documentation Coverage**: > 90% coverage
   - **Documentation Accuracy**: > 95% accuracy
   - **User Satisfaction**: > 4.5/5 rating
   - **Update Frequency**: Monthly updates

